{"b":"Ps","c":93,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"The LORD reigneth, he is clothed with majesty; the LORD is clothed with strength, wherewith he hath girded himself: the world also is stablished, that it cannot be moved.","it":[[82,91]],"x":[["Ps.96.10",19,"e"],["Ps.99.1",12,"w"],["1Chr.29.12",12,"w"],["Rev.19.6",11,"w"],["Ps.103.19",10,"r"],["Dan.4.32",9,"r"],["Dan.4.34",9,"r"],["Ps.65.6",9,"w"],["Isa.45.12",8,"r"],["Ps.104.1",8,"w"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Thy throne is established of old: thou art from everlasting.","it":[[11,13],[39,42]],"x":[["Ps.45.6",9,"w"],["Ps.90.2",6,"w"],["Prov.8.22",5,"w"],["Prov.8.23",5,"w"],["Heb.13.8",4,"r"],["Rev.2.8",3,"r"],["Rev.1.17",2,"r"],["Rev.1.18",2,"r"],["Rev.1.11",2,"r"],["Dan.4.34",2,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"The floods have lifted up, O LORD, the floods have lifted up their voice; the floods lift up their waves.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.96.11",9,"r"],["Ps.69.1",7,"r"],["Ps.69.2",7,"w"],["Ps.18.4",6,"w"],["Ps.124.3",5,"r"],["Ps.124.5",5,"r"],["Isa.55.12",5,"r"],["Isa.17.12",5,"r"],["Isa.17.13",5,"r"],["Ps.98.7",5,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"The LORD on high is mightier than the noise of many waters, yea, than the mighty waves of the sea.","it":[[17,19],[60,69]],"x":[["Ps.65.7",6,"w"],["Ps.89.9",5,"w"],["Ps.114.3",4,"w"],["Ps.114.5",4,"w"],["Job.38.11",4,"w"],["Mark.4.37",3,"w"],["Mark.4.39",3,"w"],["Jer.5.22",3,"w"],["Ps.89.6",2,"w"],["Ps.92.8",2,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Thy testimonies are very sure: holiness becometh thine house, O LORD, for ever.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.19.7",9,"w"],["Ps.19.8",9,"r"],["Ps.119.111",9,"w"],["Ps.119.129",8,"w"],["Ps.29.2",7,"w"],["1Cor.3.16",7,"r"],["1Cor.3.17",7,"r"],["Lev.19.2",7,"r"],["Ps.119.144",6,"w"],["Ps.119.138",6,"w"]]}]}